---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Accessibility" current="" description="Accessibility statement for the NeuroStat website.">
  <div class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Accessibility</div>
      <h1>Accessibility statement</h1>
      <p>Last updated: 1 September 2028</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>NeuroStat wants everyone to be able to use this website. We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2, level AA.</p>
      <h2>What we have done</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The site can be used with a keyboard and with screen readers.</li>
        <li>Text and background colours meet the contrast ratios required by level AA.</li>
        <li>Images have text alternatives, and charts have a text summary.</li>
        <li>Text can be enlarged to 200% without loss of content, and pages adapt to small screens.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Known limitations</h2>
      <p>Some PDF documents, mainly older reports, may not be fully accessible to screen readers. If you need a document in another format, please contact us and we will provide it.</p>
      <h2>Feedback</h2>
      <p>If you find a problem, write to <a href="mailto:web@neurostat.example">web@neurostat.example</a>. We aim to reply within five working days.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
